ease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nIn a rural field, farmer Xiao Liu and Xiao Zhang are harvesting crops. Xiao Liu says to Xiao Zhang: \"We harvest 80 bags of grain, most of which are wheat, some are corn, and very few are rice.\" Xiao Zhang counts and finds only 20 bags of corn.\n\n[Question]\nPlease guess how many bags of wheat are there before Xiao Zhang counts?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Before Xiao Zhang counts, guess there are 40 bags of wheat.\nB. Before Xiao Zhang counts, guess there are 60 bags of wheat.\nC. Before Xiao Zhang counts, guess there are 20 bags of wheat.\nD. Before Xiao Zhang counts, guess there are 80 bags of wheat.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.006692852509305266,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af52b3dc2ddb05a7fe2fe78","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794452285111,"createTime":"2026-11-12 10:58:05","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"bfdb8e1fd8624214b4b9d6d6312f88af"}